<Base title="Nitro Coffee Bona Fide| FAQ| Find the right answer" canonicalPath="/nitro-coffee-questions/" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Nitro Coffee Questions', path: '/nitro-coffee-questions/' }]} scaffold>
  <h1>Nitro Coffee Questions</h1>
  <p>Frequently asked questions about Bona Fide nitro coffee and tea. Can't find your answer? <a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">Contact us</a>.</p>

  <h2>Can Bona Fide make custom coffee for my customers?</h2>
  <p>Custom coffee for your own customers is a topic we handle case by case. Get in touch through the <a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">contact page</a> to discuss what you need.</p>

  <h2>What is the shelf life of Bona Fide nitro coffee, and does it need refrigeration?</h2>
  <p>Bona Fide kegs are shelf stable, with a 180-day shelf-stable keg, and can be stored at ambient temperature before tapping. See <a href="/nitro-coffee-kegs/">nitro coffee kegs</a> for how the keg is made.</p>

  <h2>What nitro tea options are available?</h2>
  <p>Bona Fide makes nitro tea as well as nitro coffee. See our <a href="/products/">products</a> for the current range.</p>

  <h2>Do you offer flavored coffee?</h2>
  <p>Flavored coffee is part of the Bona Fide range. See our <a href="/products/">products</a> for the current flavors.</p>

  <h2>What are the pallet quantities?</h2>
  <p>Pallet quantities depend on the product and format. Ask us through the <a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">contact page</a> or see <a href="/howtobuy/">How to Buy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Can I co-brand or use Alliance branding?</h2>
  <p>Co-branding and Alliance branding are handled case by case. Contact us to learn how it works.</p>

  <h2>Downloadable documents</h2>
  <p>The Nitro Coffee brochure (PDF) and the Draft System SOP are migration-remaining: their download links will be restored at their original addresses once the files are supplied.</p>
</Base>
